  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed first-floor side extension in\r\nconjunction with the existing gable end roof and rear dormer, would give rise\r\nto an unsympathetic, incongruous, bulky, obtrusive and contrived form of\r\ndevelopment which would fail to respect the scale, character, massing,\r\ncomposition and design of the host and neighbouring properties, to the\r\ndetriment of the character and appearance of the subject dwellinghouse and the\r\nvisual amenities of the area, contrary to the high quality design aspirations\r\nof National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of the London Plan\r\n(2021), Core Policy CS1 (B) of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), policy DM1 of\r\nthe Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted\r\nSupplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
